{"ID":"20240206114032-cqwupsu","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206114032-cqwupsu","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206114032-cqwupsu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206114042-wpomgmp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206114036-384fyvo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206114042-wpomgmp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:184,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:184\u0026#125;","title":"檀香","type":"doc","updated":"20240902095439"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206114042-wpomgmp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206114042-wpomgmp","updated":"20240206114045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产印度、印尼、马来西亚等地。\n【性状】\t本品为长短不一的圆柱形木段，有的略弯曲，一般长约1m，直径10"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"30cm。外表面灰黄色或黄褐色，光滑细腻，有的具疤节或纵裂，横截面呈棕黄色，显油迹；棕色年轮明显或不明显，纵向劈开纹理顺直。质坚实，不易折断。气清香，燃烧时香气更浓；味淡，嚼之微有辛辣感。饮片多为卷曲或破碎的刨片，表面灰黄色，较粗糙，有细致的刨裂纹。\n【性味】\t辛，温。\n【功效】\t行气温中，开胃止痛。用于寒凝气滞，胸痛，腹痛，胃痛食少；冠心病，心绞痛。\n【附注】\t檀香 (Santalum album) 在《世界自然保护联盟濒危物种红色名录》被列为易危物种。"}]},{"ID":"20240206114036-384fyvo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206114036-384fyvo","updated":"20240206114036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206114036-joat0v5.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715163146-baz6w5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715163146-baz6w5w","updated":"20240715170200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 450px;","style":"width: 440px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"檀香树 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/檀香树 2-20240715163410-mpbkw5o.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 440px;\" parent-style=\"width: 450px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 515px;","style":"width: 505px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"檀香树 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/檀香树 14-20240715170158-lvci1k4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 505px;\" parent-style=\"width: 515px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715163548-zvipv8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715163548-zvipv8c","updated":"20240715165532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 488px;","style":"width: 478px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"檀香树 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/檀香树 12-20240715165414-ptzvcrx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 478px;\" parent-style=\"width: 488px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 636px;","style":"width: 626px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"檀香树 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/檀香树 4-20240715163548-6r00zix.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 626px;\" parent-style=\"width: 636px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"202407